# Keep build products out of the build context.
#
# Every Containerfile here does `COPY apexd/ /build/apexd/` and then builds it.
# A developer's local `cargo build` leaves ~440 MB of host-built artefacts in
# apexd/target, and without this they are shipped into the context and land on
# top of the container's own target directory — host rustc and glibc output
# seeding a container build. CI never noticed because a fresh checkout has no
# target/; a local build is where it bites, and "works in CI, wrong locally" is
# the harder direction to debug.
apexd/target/
**/target/

.git/
